Monster Party Recompiled @VERSION@

GET STARTED

Windows: extract the complete ZIP, then open MonsterPartyRecomp.exe.
Linux: make the AppImage executable, then open it.
Select your original Monster Party (USA) ROM and choose PLAY.
No game ROM is included.

WIDESCREEN

Open Mods > Display and enable Adaptive Widescreen. Aspect is the only setting:
Fit follows your window; 16:9, 21:9 and 32:9 are also available. Enemies appear
across the wider view, and the stage camera stops at level edges. The HUD and
boss rooms stay centered.

CHEATS AND RESTORATION

Mods > Cheats includes invincibility, one-hit kills, Endless Bert, starting
energy and round, walking speed, and jump height. All start disabled.
Mods > Restoration includes Prototype Restoration 1.0 by Cubivore10, restoring
title colors, monster artwork and scenery. Select it before starting the game.
It supports widescreen, save states and rewind, and never changes your ROM file.
Source: https://www.romhacking.net/hacks/1516/
Current archive: https://www.romhack.ing/hacks/1516/

CONTROLS AND PROGRESS

Arrow keys: move. Z: A. X: B. Enter: Start. Backslash: Select.
Escape: menu. Change keyboard and controller bindings in the launcher.
F7: save-state browser. Choose a slot; S saves, Enter loads, Escape closes.
F8: rewind. Left/Right selects a moment; Enter resumes there, Escape cancels.
Controller: Back+L3 opens save states, Back+R3 opens rewind. Use the D-pad to
choose, X to save, A to load/resume, B to close. Rewind starts enabled; change
its history settings in the launcher.
Save states are specific to a build; keep the game's passwords for progress
you want to carry into an update.
Use the same cheat settings when loading a save state. Changing mods starts
a fresh rewind history.

UPDATES AND HELP

https://github.com/mstan/MonsterPartyNESRecomp
When reporting a problem, include your version, operating system, aspect
setting and the steps that caused it. A screenshot is helpful.

Project and third-party licenses are in licenses/.
